...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

user: 사용자 { class: person }
ui: Streamlit UI { class: ours }
model_chain: ModelChain { class: ours }
deepseek: DeepSeek Reasoner API { class: ext }
session: 세션 상태 { class: store }

user -> ui: 키 2개 + 프롬프트(chat_input) 제출
ui -> model_chain: ModelChain(deepseek_key, anthropic_key) 생성
ui -> session: user 메시지 append
ui -> model_chain: get_deepseek_reasoning(prompt) 호출
model_chain -> deepseek: system_prompt(JSON 스키마 지정) + prompt로 create() 호출
deepseek -> model_chain: reasoning_content + content 문자열
model_chain -> ui: (reasoning_content, content) 튜플 반환
